id: functional-purpose
name: Functional Purpose
order: 5
category: mind
importance: secondary
options: 1
optionEffect: 2
# (1)'s two choices, asked as it is gained: a Skill for the Rank, then one with 2+ Ranks for the Critical Target - neither
# Perception (racial.mjs choicesFor).
choose: skill
choose2: skillRanked
chooseExcept: perception
description: >
  Specialization allows the diversity of Android designs to truly shine, allowing each Android to excel far and above others in one specific area of expertise.
text: >
  Functional Purpose (Mind): Specialization allows the diversity of Android designs to truly shine, allowing each Android to excel far and above others in one specific area of expertise.
  (1)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Racial Trait, gain a Skill Rank in a Skill of your choice, then reduce the Critical Target for a Skill you have 2+ Skill Ranks in by 1. You cannot choose Perception for either choice.
  (2)-[Option]: Upon gaining this Racial Trait, choose one of the following effects:

  * Destroyer [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, you may spend 2(T) Ki Points to apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.
  * Protector [Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Opponent hits one of your Allies with an Attacking Maneuver, you may use the Intervene Maneuver without spending a Counter Action as long as you are within 8 Squares of that Ally. If you do, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.
  * Companion [Passive]: While Personality has the highest Attribute Score amongst your Attributes, increase your Combat Rolls and Initiative Rolls by 1(bT).
  * Researcher [Passive]: While Scholarship has the highest Attribute Score amongst your Attributes, increase your Combat Rolls and Initiative Rolls by 1(bT).
  * Leader [Passive]: Increase the Combat Rolls of all your Minions by 1(T) and increase their Maximum Life Points by 5(bT).

---

# (1) The Rank, counted with the Progression tab's; the Critical Target, 1 lower on that Skill's Checks.
[passive]
skill.$choice.ranks += 1;
skill.$choice2.criticalTarget -= 1;

# (2) The Option chosen, one file each beside this one.
